{"ID":"20240118145020-hou3xgj","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118145020-hou3xgj","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145020-hou3xgj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118145020-xa0bsf0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122160308-iipx354\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122160308-iipx354\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:496,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:496\u0026#125;","title":"306蚤休","type":"doc","updated":"20240204111854"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118145020-xa0bsf0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118145020-xa0bsf0","updated":"20240122160250"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味苦，微寒，有毒。治惊痫，摇头。弄舌，热气在腹中，癫疾，痈疮，阴蚀，下三虫，去蛇毒。生川谷。一名蚩休。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160252-c2pdqh6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160252-c2pdqh6"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】处处有之，生于深山阴湿之地。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160253-bplx5jg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160253-bplx5jg"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦，微寒，有毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160254-5rwpl7r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160254-5rwpl7r"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】蚤休主散结导热，治寒热，疟疾，癫疾，痈疽，瘰疬，解蛇毒虫（磨醋敷）。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160256-027hsly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160256-027hsly"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】癫疾痈疮，除蚀，下三虫，去蛇毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160258-0n3m6km","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160258-0n3m6km"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】治胎风手足搐，能吐泄瘰疬。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160259-w562w0z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160259-w562w0z"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通五分至二钱，外用无定量。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160300-jlmmbtb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160300-jlmmbtb"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】以治外证，殊有功效，但其性苦寒，不宜多服，元气虚者忌之。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122160250-8d03xyp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160250-8d03xyp"}},{"ID":"20240122160308-iipx354","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122160308-iipx354","updated":"20240204111854"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三O六，看这个蚤休，长成这个样子。这个处方呢，过去我们使用在专门解蛇毒，被蛇咬到，被这个响尾蛇咬到，那个台湾的百步蛇，哦，你说老师我们试看看，你不用试，到没药的时候你再用嘛，你不要没事抓个百步蛇来试看看，不需要。临床上使用的时候，一般来说，我们是用3钱，有些重剂的时候，会用到5钱，那如果说我们外用也可以打成粉，涂在咬伤的伤口上面，一般来说我们用解毒的药，诸位记得，我们取它的迅捷的时候，我们希望它到身上去很快地去把毒素中和掉的时候，我们都是用汤剂，汤者荡也，那你不要神经病去加个甘草进去，懂不懂我的意思？甘草是缓，那你减缓它的速度了，我们需要药比较缓慢发挥的时候，慢慢进去的时候，我们就会用到甘草，有些药跑得太快了，必需要用甘草，有些状况是危急的，你必须要让药走得很快，这个时候，你不要加甘草在里面，比如说我们前面开的利水的药，比较如商陆、甘遂、芫花、大戟，牵牛，这种崚药，我们在攻的时候，我们一般放红枣进去保护胃，你不要放个甘草，这个是外行，这个会误人生命的，甘草就不能用，会让药的速度缓下来的。那主治，诸位看：导散热，哦，导热，寒热，这个解蛇毒，这个最多用的就是在蛇毒上面。"}]}]}